 "markup": "<div class=\"m-news\"><div class=\"m-section-nav font-num\"><!----> <div class=\"m-section-nav-inner\"><div class=\"m-section-nav-label\">新闻资讯</div> <div class=\"m-section-nav-en\">News &amp; Info</div> <div class=\"m-section-nav-num\">04</div></div></div> <div class=\"m-news-container section-wrap\"><div class=\"m-news-slider\"><div class=\"m-news-slider__title\">News &amp; Info</div></div> <div class=\"m-news-main\"><div class=\"m-news-tab\"><div class=\"m-news-tab__thumb\" style=\"left: 0.12rem;\"></div> <a href=\"/m/zh-cn/news\" aria-current=\"page\" class=\"m-news-tab__item nuxt-link-exact-active nuxt-link-active m-news-tab__item--active\"><div class=\"m-news-tab__label\">\n            最新\n          </div></a><a href=\"/m/zh-cn/news?category=295\" class=\"m-news-tab__item\"><div class=\"m-news-tab__label\">\n            新闻\n          </div></a><a href=\"/m/zh-cn/news?category=296\" class=\"m-news-tab__item\"><div class=\"m-news-tab__label\">\n            公告\n          </div></a><a href=\"/m/zh-cn/news?category=297\" class=\"m-news-tab__item\"><div class=\"m-news-tab__label\">\n            活动\n          </div></a></div> <div class=\"m-news-list\"><a href=\"/m/zh-cn/news/166535\" class=\"m-news-list__item\"><div class=\"m-news-list__item-banner\"><img src=\"https://fastcdn.hoyoverse.com/content-v2/nap/166535/8334e2038691c9699e548dfbf577f894_2628406247496769925.jpg\" alt=\"banner\"></div> <div class=\"m-news-list__item-content\"><div class=\"m-news-list__item-date\"><div>2026/10/01</div> <div class=\"news-tag mobile\">\n  新闻\n</div></div> <div class=\"m-news-list__item-title ellipsis\">\n              《绝区零》2026年10月月历壁纸\n            </div> <div class=\"m-news-list__item-desc ellipsis\">亲爱的绳匠，欢迎下载&amp;使用10月月历壁纸~</div></div></a><a href=\"/m/zh-cn/news/166498\" class=\"m-news-list__item\"><div class=\"m-news-list__item-banner\"><img src=\"https://fastcdn.hoyoverse.com/content-v2/nap/166498/801579a8589b04bef42c4d475bc6ba81_9070677666140127897.jpg\" alt=\"banner\"></div> <div class=\"m-news-list__item-content\"><div class=\"m-news-list__item-date\"><div>2026/10/01</div> <div class=\"news-tag mobile\">\n  公告\n</div></div> <div class=\"m-news-list__item-title ellipsis\">\n              「跛脚乌鸦奇探录」活动说明\n            </div> <div class=\"m-news-list__item-desc ellipsis\">「跛脚乌鸦奇探录」活动说明</div></div></a><a href=\"/m/zh-cn/news/166497\" class=\"m-news-list__item\"><div class=\"m-news-list__item-banner\"><img src=\"https://fastcdn.hoyoverse.com/content-v2/nap/166497/721f26d02e752b034fa4c0375060333d_6904896181431312895.jpg\" alt=\"banner\"></div> <div class=\"m-news-list__item-content\"><div class=\"m-news-list__item-date\"><div>2026/09/30</div> <div class=\"news-tag mobile\">\n  新闻\n</div></div> <div class=\"m-news-list__item-title ellipsis\">\n              她与她的隐秘往事丨3.2版本内容一览（下期）\n            </div> <div class=\"m-news-list__item-desc ellipsis\">绳匠们好，3.2版本现已开启！S级代理人[洛克茜(风·击破)]、[普罗米娅(冰·异常)]与S级音擎[绯月银棺(击破)]、[朔月裁霜(异常)]加入限时频段~ </div></div></a><a href=\"/m/zh-cn/news/166496\" class=\"m-news-list__item\"><div class=\"m-news-list__item-banner\"><img src=\"https://fastcdn.hoyoverse.com/content-v2/nap/166496/6e21865917d0d671b4821d0be5ba6c10_7627518777412622827.jpg\" alt=\"banner\"></div> <div class=\"m-news-list__item-content\"><div class=\"m-news-list__item-date\"><div>2026/09/29</div> <div class=\"news-tag mobile\">\n  新闻\n</div></div> <div class=\"m-news-list__item-title ellipsis\">\n              生日快乐南宫羽丨绝无仅有的大奖\n            </div> <div class=\"m-news-list__item-desc ellipsis\">「欢迎光临『盒』玩具店，我是今日店长南宫羽，有什么问题都可以找我哦~」</div></div></a><a href=\"/m/zh-cn/news/166476\" class=\"m-news-list__item\"><div class=\"m-news-list__item-banner\"><img src=\"https://fastcdn.hoyoverse.com/content-v2/nap/166476/3cb9766cf1ffc6f694c9257033575df5_4878917223056569186.jpg\" alt=\"banner\"></div> <div class=\"m-news-list__item-content\"><div class=\"m-news-list__item-date\"><div>2026/09/28</div> <div class=\"news-tag mobile\">\n  公告\n</div></div> <div class=\"m-news-list__item-title ellipsis\">\n              「锵锵！球仔成长日记」活动说明\n            </div> <div class=\"m-news-list__item-desc ellipsis\">「锵锵！球仔成长日记」活动说明</div></div></a><a href=\"/m/zh-cn/news/166475\" class=\"m-news-list__item\"><div class=\"m-news-list__item-banner\"><img src=\"https://fastcdn.hoyoverse.com/content-v2/nap/166475/5e5c5daefb39338f4a40d31a3b4a9ccf_7857193178439832577.jpg\" alt=\"banner\"></div> <div class=\"m-news-list__item-content\"><div class=\"m-news-list__item-date\"><div>2026/09/28</div> <div class=\"news-tag mobile\">\n  公告\n</div></div> <div class=\"m-news-list__item-title ellipsis\">\n              3.2版本限时频段（下期）\n            </div> <div class=\"m-news-list__item-desc ellipsis\">3.2版本限时频段（下期）</div></div></a><a href=\"/m/zh-cn/news/166474\" class=\"m-news-list__item\"><div class=\"m-news-list__item-banner\"><img src=\"https://fastcdn.hoyoverse.com/content-v2/nap/166474/94a8b21ac95365618e5113bee72be78f_6196668736871295541.jpg\" alt=\"banner\"></div> <div class=\"m-news-list__item-content\"><div class=\"m-news-list__item-date\"><div>2026/09/27</div> <div class=\"news-tag mobile\">\n  新闻\n</div></div> <div class=\"m-news-list__item-title ellipsis\">\n              代理人机制介绍丨洛克茜篇\n            </div> <div class=\"m-news-list__item-desc ellipsis\">资料库中已收录代理人「洛克茜」的战斗相关信息，重点内容解析完毕，请查收。</div></div></a><a href=\"/m/zh-cn/news/166451\" class=\"m-news-list__item\"><div class=\"m-news-list__item-banner\"><img src=\"https://fastcdn.hoyoverse.com/content-v2/nap/166451/b261b703d4029c81ac10c5915eac1a58_8124598418017673992.jpg\" alt=\"banner\"></div> <div class=\"m-news-list__item-content\"><div class=\"m-news-list__item-date\"><div>2026/09/26</div> <div class=\"news-tag mobile\">\n  新闻\n</div></div> <div class=\"m-news-list__item-title ellipsis\">\n              代理人未归档影像丨洛克茜篇\n            </div> <div class=\"m-news-list__item-desc ellipsis\">「来得正好，翘班的理由找到了。」</div></div></a><a href=\"/m/zh-cn/news/166450\" class=\"m-news-list__item\"><div class=\"m-news-list__item-banner\"